      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The Ice Man—Jack MacIntosh is the knife sharpest enforcer of street hustles you've got around; he survived holding down neighborhoods and racing with Long John Silver, but sometimes Jack just got pushed around when he's trying to make a little beauty off his back – bad for his business in the long run. Most men are scared to mess with Jack, but Jack's had his wars and someone else putting their trust on Johnny Lightning half the time, (which is a promising prospect,) but this poor jack needs to find some steel as quickly as he can in the mean streets, and bad things come for those that waste time with The Ice Man.\n\nThen there's Steve Salvatore—Steve Salvatore is a local hood who trades on the fear of other neighborhood sticks, preys on drug addicts and scurries around illegally gathering information like everyone's natural born app and serves notice to anyone dodging the number here. Steve was once an apple of his parents' eye on the right and wrong side, until his step-mother had the daring to erase his mistakes, and he's spent his days running this little hole. Steve's vulnerable, he's the type to pull out the runt and keep it, and usually you won't, so beware.\n\nLast is Marty",
